{"seq":2,"slug":"retry-backoff-circuit","title":"重试退避、熔断与故障注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-service-engineering/middleware-resilience/retry-backoff-circuit","wordCount":3103,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试退避-熔断与故障注入\">重试退避、熔断与故障注入</h1><p>重试是唯一一种「加上去就能让可用性变差」的可靠性机制。它的逻辑很简单——失败了再做一次——但如果没有约束，它会精确地在系统最脆弱的时候施加最大压力：下游一慢，所有调用方同时重试，负载翻倍，下游更慢，重试更多。这条反馈路径有一个正式名字叫重试风暴，2026 年仍然是分布式系统里最常见的自伤模式之一。这一篇讲的是怎么让重试是安全的、熔断是什么时候比重试更合适的答案、以及怎么证明这些防护真的生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先建立一个判断顺序。遇到一个失败，可能的动作有四类，选择取决于失败的<strong>性质</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败性质</th>\n<th>判断依据</th>\n<th>正确动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>瞬时抖动（连接被重置、超时、5xx）</td>\n<td>请求<strong>未到达</strong>或明确可重放</td>\n<td>退避后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过载（429、503 + Retry-After）</td>\n<td>对端明确说了「现在别来」</td>\n<td>按对端给的时长退避，不加码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性失败（400、401、403、404、409、422）</td>\n<td>请求本身有问题</td>\n<td><strong>不重试</strong>，直接上报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定（请求已发出、响应丢失）</td>\n<td>无法判断副作用是否发生</td>\n<td>只在操作幂等时重试，否则对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行和第四行是重试事故的主要来源。对 400 重试毫无意义（同样的请求会得到同样的拒绝），只会浪费配额；对「已发出但响应丢失」的请求盲目重试，可能造成重复转账、重复下单。因此在写重试逻辑之前必须先回答：<strong>这个操作幂等吗？</strong> 如果否，先设计幂等性（用幂等键让服务端识别重复），再谈重试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[调用下游失败] --&gt; B{错误分类}&#10;  B --&gt;|4xx 除 429| C[不重试&lt;br/&gt;记录并上报]&#10;  B --&gt;|429 / 503 带 Retry-After| D[按对端时长退避&lt;br/&gt;不加码不抖动]&#10;  B --&gt;|超时 / 连接失败| E{操作幂等?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[不重试&lt;br/&gt;触发对账流程]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G{熔断器状态}&#10;  G --&gt;|Closed| H[指数退避 + 抖动&lt;br/&gt;重试至预算耗尽]&#10;  G --&gt;|Open| I[快速失败&lt;br/&gt;不再打下游]&#10;  G --&gt;|Half-Open| J[放行少量探测请求]&#10;  H --&gt; K{连续失败阈值}&#10;  K --&gt;|达到| L[熔断器 → Open]&#10;  J --&gt;|成功| M[熔断器 → Closed&lt;br/&gt;恢复流量]&#10;  J --&gt;|失败| I\">flowchart TD\n  A[调用下游失败] --&gt; B{错误分类}\n  B --&gt;|4xx 除 429| C[不重试&lt;br/&gt;记录并上报]\n  B --&gt;|429 / 503 带 Retry-After| D[按对端时长退避&lt;br/&gt;不加码不抖动]\n  B --&gt;|超时 / 连接失败| E{操作幂等?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[不重试&lt;br/&gt;触发对账流程]\n  E --&gt;|是| G{熔断器状态}\n  G --&gt;|Closed| H[指数退避 + 抖动&lt;br/&gt;重试至预算耗尽]\n  G --&gt;|Open| I[快速失败&lt;br/&gt;不再打下游]\n  G --&gt;|Half-Open| J[放行少量探测请求]\n  H --&gt; K{连续失败阈值}\n  K --&gt;|达到| L[熔断器 → Open]\n  J --&gt;|成功| M[熔断器 → Closed&lt;br/&gt;恢复流量]\n  J --&gt;|失败| I</pre><p>图中熔断器的存在理由正是「重试解决不了持续故障」。重试假设失败是暂时的，当失败变成持续状态时，重试只是把故障放大到调用方自身——线程/任务被占满、上游收到超时、级联崩溃。熔断器的作用是在检测到持续故障后<strong>主动放弃调用</strong>，把资源留给还能工作的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指数退避与抖动的算法细节\">指数退避与抖动的算法细节</h2><p><code>tower</code> 生态里最常用的重试工具是 <code>tower::retry::RetryLayer</code>（配合 <code>Policy</code>）以及 <code>tower-http</code> 的部分层；如果需求更细（按错误分类决定重试、带预算），自研一个 <code>Layer</code> 更可控，因为 <code>Policy</code> 的抽象只给 <code>fn retry(&amp;mut self, req, result) -&gt; Option&lt;Future&gt;</code> 这一个决策点（<code>Policy</code> 只有 <code>retry</code> 与 <code>clone_request</code> 两个方法，返回 <code>None</code> 表示不重试，<code>Some(future)</code> 表示在该 future 完成后重试——来源：tower <code>retry::Policy</code> 文档, <a href=\"https://docs.rs/tower/latest/tower/retry/trait.Policy.html），缺少「按状态码分类」的表达。\">https://docs.rs/tower/latest/tower/retry/trait.Policy.html），缺少「按状态码分类」的表达。</a></p>\n<p>退避时间的计算有几个被反复验证过的结论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指数增长</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">base \\times 2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">base</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span></span></span></span></span> 通常 50<del>200ms，指数上限通常 2</del>10s。纯线性增长（每次加固定值）在故障恢复时来不及降速。</li>\n<li><strong>抖动是必须的，不是优化</strong>：如果所有客户端都按同一个公式等同样的时间，它们的重试会在时间上对齐，形成周期性的脉冲式负载。这是为什么「不加抖动的指数退避在生产环境等同于没有退避」。抖动有几种常见形态（下表研究结论来源：AWS Architecture Blog, Exponential Backoff and Jitter, <a href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/）：\">https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/）：</a></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抖动策略</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = base \\cdot 2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>会形成同步脉冲，不要用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Full Jitter</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\text{rand}(0,\\ base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分散最好，平均等待最短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Equal Jitter</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\frac{base \\cdot 2^n}{2} + \\text{rand}(0, \\frac{base \\cdot 2^n}{2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.256em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.256em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保留部分增长，兼顾分散</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decorrelated Jitter</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\min(cap,\\ \\text{rand}(base,\\ t_{prev} \\cdot 3))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无需知道第几次，适合长序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS 推荐（历史）</td>\n<td>Full Jitter 与 Equal Jitter 的对比研究结论</td>\n<td>Full Jitter 在总调用量与完成时间上综合最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>Full Jitter</code> 在实践中通常是最好的默认选择，代价是「等待时间可能很短」——这在故障早期可能造成几次快速重试，但因为总重试次数有上限，额外压力可控。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>重试预算（retry budget）</strong>：比固定次数更稳健的做法是限制「重试请求占总请求的比例」。例如允许重试量不超过成功量的 10%——这样在正常情况下重试很充裕，而在大面积故障时重试自动收缩，因为成功量掉下去了。这个机制（在 Envoy、Finagle 里都有实现）比「最多重试 3 次」更能防止重试风暴，因为固定次数在故障时会随请求量线性放大。（Envoy 的 <code>retry_budget</code> 把并发重试限制为「活跃请求 + 活跃 pending 请求」之和的一个百分比，<code>budget_percent</code> 默认 20%、<code>min_retry_concurrency</code> 默认 3——来源：Envoy circuit_breaker.proto 文档, <a href=\"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto）\">https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/config/cluster/v3/circuit_breaker.proto）</a></p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>总时限（deadline）而非总次数</strong>：重试必须在入口的 <a href=\"tower-layer-service\">超时预算</a> 之内完成。如果入口给 5s、每次调用超时 2s、退避 1s，那么最多只能做两轮。以「剩余时间是否还够一次完整调用」作为是否继续重试的条件，比数次数更符合实际约束。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>不要在同一个请求里同时重试和并发</strong>：一个常见的「优化」是同时向两个副本发请求取先返回者（hedged request），以降低尾延迟。它在读操作上有效，但会<strong>成倍增加下游负载</strong>，且在有状态服务上会引发重复副作用。采用它必须配严格的预算控制（比如只对 p99 超过阈值的请求发起对冲，且最多对冲一次）。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"熔断器的状态机与阈值\">熔断器的状态机与阈值</h2><p>熔断器有三个状态：<code>Closed</code>（正常放行）、<code>Open</code>（拒绝全部请求）、<code>Half-Open</code>（放行少量探测）。这部分的机制与本 hub 其他篇没有重叠，成本核算的关键参数是阈值和探测比例。（三态模型与「达到阈值就跳闸」的原始定义见 Martin Fowler, CircuitBreaker, <a href=\"https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CircuitBreaker.html）\">https://martinfowler.com/bliki/CircuitBreaker.html）</a></p>\n<p>参数设置上有几个基于实践的建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基于滑动窗口而非连续计数</strong>。用「最近 N 秒内的失败率」而不是「连续失败 M 次」，因为后者在低流量下会误触发（一个请求都没有时也不会触发，但只有两个请求时失败一次就 50%）。滑动窗口的失败触发条件通常是「窗口内请求数 ≥ 最小样本量（如 20）且失败率 &gt; 阈值（如 50%）」。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口长度取下游恢复时间的量级</strong>。如果下游通常 10 秒内恢复，窗口用 10~30 秒；太短会反复开合（抖动），太长会让熔断打开后长时间无法恢复。</li>\n<li><strong>Half-Open 只放行极少量请求</strong>（比如 1~5 个并发），且成功若干个才回到 <code>Closed</code>。放行太多等于没有熔断。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Open</code> 状态也要有超时</strong>，超时后自动进入 <code>Half-Open</code> 探测。没有这个自动转换，熔断器需要人工重置，等于把故障恢复变成了人工介入。</li>\n<li><strong>熔断要按依赖实例/分片粒度做</strong>。全局熔断一个有多副本的依赖，会在一个副本故障时把整个依赖判死。粒度选择与 <a href=\"../state-shutdown/arc-rwlock-state\">Arc/RwLock 状态、连接池与 interior mutability</a> 里连接池的分池粒度是同一个问题——粒度过粗会让局部故障扩散。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>熔断打开时的<strong>降级行为</strong>必须提前设计，因为那时你没得选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>降级策略</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>返回缓存/陈旧数据</td>\n<td>读操作、容忍陈旧</td>\n<td>需要缓存里的数据还在且标注了陈旧度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回部分数据</td>\n<td>列表类接口（缺一部分非关键字段）</td>\n<td>客户端可能不理解为何字段缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回明确的 503</td>\n<td>无法降级的关键路径</td>\n<td>用户体验直接下降，但语义清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳过非关键步骤</td>\n<td>推荐、风控初筛、埋点</td>\n<td>需要确认跳过是安全的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排队稍后处理</td>\n<td>写操作</td>\n<td>需要可靠队列与幂等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「跳过非关键步骤」这一项容易被滥用成「静默降级」，从而把故障隐藏起来。纪律是：任何降级都必须<strong>可观测</strong>——降级计数要有指标、降级发生要有 warn 级日志、且不变量（比如「金额计算必须用实时库存」）不得被降级破坏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障注入-证明防护真的生效\">故障注入：证明防护真的生效</h2><p>写了超时、重试、熔断、限流之后，最容易犯的错误是假设它们生效。验证它们的唯一可靠方式是主动注入故障。</p>\n<p>故障注入的层次从轻到重：</p>\n<p><strong>单元级</strong>：把下游客户端抽象成 trait，测试中用可控的 stub 实现延迟与失败：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[async_trait]&#10;trait InventoryClient: Send + Sync {&#10;    async fn reserve(&amp;self, sku: &amp;Sku, qty: u32) -&gt; Result&lt;Reservation, InventoryError&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct FlakyClient { fail_first: AtomicU32, delay: Duration }&#10;&#10;#[async_trait]&#10;impl InventoryClient for FlakyClient {&#10;    async fn reserve(&amp;self, sku: &amp;Sku, qty: u32) -&gt; Result&lt;Reservation, InventoryError&gt; {&#10;        if self.fail_first.fetch_sub(1, Ordering::SeqCst) &gt; 0 {&#10;            return Err(InventoryError::Unavailable);&#10;        }&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(self.delay).await;&#10;        Ok(Reservation::new(sku, qty))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[async_trait]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trait InventoryClient: Send + Sync {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn reserve(&#x26;self, sku: &#x26;Sku, qty: u32) -> Result&#x3C;Reservation, InventoryError>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct FlakyClient { fail_first: AtomicU32, delay: Duration }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[async_trait]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl InventoryClient for FlakyClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn reserve(&#x26;self, sku: &#x26;Sku, qty: u32) -> Result&#x3C;Reservation, InventoryError> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if self.fail_first.fetch_sub(1, Ordering::SeqCst) > 0 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return Err(InventoryError::Unavailable);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(self.delay).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(Reservation::new(sku, qty))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这类 stub 能验证三件事：重试次数与退避总时长符合预期（用 <code>tokio::time::pause()</code> 加虚拟时钟，让测试不必真等）；熔断在阈值达到后确实开始快速失败；降级路径被走到且返回值符合契约。</p>\n<p><code>tokio::time::pause()</code> 值得单独提：它让 <code>tokio::time::sleep</code> 使用虚拟时钟，测试可以瞬移时间（<code>pause()</code> 保存当前 instant，之后 <code>Instant::now()</code> 返回保存值；runtime 空闲时虚拟时钟会自动推进到下一个 pending timer——来源：tokio <code>time::pause</code> 文档, <a href=\"https://docs.rs/tokio/latest/tokio/time/fn.pause.html）。没有它，验证「指数退避到\">https://docs.rs/tokio/latest/tokio/time/fn.pause.html）。没有它，验证「指数退避到</a> 5 秒上限」的测试要真跑十几秒，没人会写。</p>\n<p><strong>集成级</strong>：在真实依赖（比如测试用的 Postgres）上用代理注入延迟与断连。<code>toxiproxy</code> 是这类工具的常见选择：它为每个连接开一个本地端口，可以动态注入 <code>latency</code>、<code>timeout</code>、<code>reset_peer</code> 等毒物（来源：toxiproxy 项目 README，支持 latency / timeout / reset_peer / bandwidth / slow_close / slicer / limit_data / packet_loss 等 toxic，<a href=\"https://github.com/Shopify/toxiproxy）。这也是验证**连接池行为**的唯一可靠手段——连接池在「连接被中途\">https://github.com/Shopify/toxiproxy）。这也是验证**连接池行为**的唯一可靠手段——连接池在「连接被中途</a> reset」时的表现（是否会清掉坏连接、是否会重连、重连是否风暴）只有在真实 TCP 层才能观察到。这一点与 <a href=\"../state-shutdown/arc-rwlock-state\">Arc/RwLock 状态、连接池与 interior mutability</a> 里讨论的池健康管理是同一件事。</p>\n<p><strong>混沌级</strong>：在生产或预发环境按计划注入故障（杀掉实例、注入网络分区、打满 CPU）。它的价值是验证「跨实例」的防护——比如熔断器是本地的，一个依赖的某个分片故障时，各实例的熔断是否会一致触发；限流的全局配额在实例重启后是否会短暂超额。<strong>混沌实验必须有停止条件和爆炸半径限制</strong>，且要能在指标异常时自动中止。</p>\n<p>故障注入的一条纪律是：<strong>每个防护机制都要有一个「移除它就会失败」的测试</strong>。如果删掉重试逻辑测试依然全绿，那说明测试没有真正覆盖失败路径——这是一个具体的、可检查的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>先判断失败性质再决定动作：瞬时抖动可退避重试、429/503 按对端给的时长退避、确定性 4xx 不重试、副作用不明的只在幂等时重试并对账。</li>\n<li>指数退避必须配抖动：无抖动会让客户端重试同步成脉冲；<code>Full Jitter</code>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = \\text{rand}(0, base \\cdot 2^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）综合表现最好。</li>\n<li>用「重试预算」（重试量不超过成功量的比例）和「总时限」而非固定次数——固定次数在大面积故障时会随请求量线性放大。</li>\n<li>熔断器三态：<code>Closed</code>/<code>Open</code>/<code>Half-Open</code>；用滑动窗口失败率 + 最小样本量而非连续计数；<code>Open</code> 必须有超时自动转 <code>Half-Open</code>；粒度按依赖分片而非全局。</li>\n<li>降级策略必须提前设计且必须可观测，不变量不得被降级破坏。</li>\n<li>用 <code>tokio::time::pause()</code> 虚拟时钟验证退避、用 stub 客户端验证熔断与降级、用 <code>toxiproxy</code> 验证连接池在连接中断下的行为、用混沌实验验证跨实例行为。每个防护都要有一个「删掉它就红」的测试。</li>\n<li>硬币的另一面是超时：重试与超时共享同一份预算，见 <a href=\"tower-layer-service\">tower Layer/Service、超时与限流</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些层产生的失败与重试事件必须能被查询与聚合，否则调参只能靠猜——见 <a href=\"tracing-observability\">tracing 订阅者、结构化日志与指标</a>；幂等键的实现依赖共享状态与存储，见 <a href=\"../state-shutdown/arc-rwlock-state\">Arc/RwLock 状态、连接池与 interior mutability</a>；取消如何让被放弃的重试及时停止，见 <a href=\"../state-shutdown/channels-task-supervision\">channel 任务编排、取消与监督</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重试退避、熔断与故障注入","id":"重试退避-熔断与故障注入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指数退避与抖动的算法细节","id":"指数退避与抖动的算法细节"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断器的状态机与阈值","id":"熔断器的状态机与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"故障注入：证明防护真的生效","id":"故障注入-证明防护真的生效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"tower Layer/Service、超时与限流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-service-engineering/middleware-resilience/tower-layer-service"},"next":{"title":"tracing 订阅者、结构化日志与指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-service-engineering/middleware-resilience/tracing-observability"}}